    <data key="d0">Accenture Knowledge Management Architecture for Oil and Gas</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Architecture ingests unstructured documents, uses SageMaker and Comprehend for extraction/NLP, and builds a knowledge graph in Neptune alongside indexing in Elasticsearch.</data>
